    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi nibasingura omukama Ogi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma twakubuka, twakwata omuhanda ogurukugenda Basani; Ogi omukama wa Basani hamu n'abantu be boona yaija kuturwanisa omukiikaro Ederi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA yangambira ati: “Otamutiina, mmazire ira kumukuta omungaro hamu n'abantu be, n'ensi ye, noija kumukora nkooku wakozire Sihooni omukama w'Abamooli abaikaraga Hesibboni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, omukama Ogi owa Basani n'abantu be, na uwe yabatuta omungaro, twamusingura, abantu be boona twabaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, twakwata embuga ze zoona, hatasigale rubuga na rumu oru tutarabanyagireho, embuga nkaaga, ensi yoona ey'Arugoobi, obukama bwa Ogi obw'omunsi Basani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga ezi zoona zikaba zizitiriirwe ebisiika ebiraihire, zitairwemu amalembo n'ebihongozo, kandi hakaba haroho ebyaro bingi muno ebikaba bitazitiirweho bisiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga ezi tukazihwerekerereza kimu nkooku twakozire Sihooni omukama wa Hesibboni, oteho n'embuga ezindi zoona, twaita abasaija, abakazi n'abaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ente zoona n'ebindi ebi twaihire omumbuga, nugwo gwabaire munyago gwaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, ensi ey'ekaba eri y'abakama ababiri ab'Abamooli, abakaba bali obuseeribwa Yorudaani, okuruga hakihanga eky'Arumooli, okugarukira harusozi Herumooni, nukwo twagitwaire tuti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Abasidoni, orusozi Herumooni barweta Siryoni, kandi Abamooli abo, bamweta Senira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twakwata embuga zoona ez'omukyeya, Giryadi yoona na Basani, okuhikira kimu Saleka na Ederi, embuga ez'omubukama bwa Ogi owa Basani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha Balefaimu endagalikwa, Ogi wenka omukama wa Basani, nuwe yali akyasigaireho. Ekitabu kye kikaba kiri ky'ekyoma; obura bwakyo bukaba buli bwa mita ina, obugazi mita ibiri kusigikira harulengo rw'akasumi ako; nahati kikyaliyo murubuga Rabba orw'Abamooni.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rubbeni, Gaadi n'ekicweka eky'oruganda rwa Manaase nibaikara Burugaizooba bwa Yorudaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako obu twaliire ensi egi, Abarubbeni n'Abagaadi, nkabaha ensi erukutandikira harubuga Aroheri orunyakuli hansaro ey'ekihanga eky'Arumooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ekicweka eky'ensozi eya Giryadi hamu n'embuga zaayo; ekicweka kya Giryadi ekyasigaireho, na Basani yoona, nziburo obukama bwa Ogi, (ensi yoona ey'Ara ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairo ow'oruganda rwa Manaase, akatwara ensi yoona ey'Aragobi, niyo Basani, okuhikira kimu ha mutaano ogw'Abagesura n'Abamaakati; ebyaro ebi yabiruka ibara lye “byaro bya Yairo”, na hati hoona, nukwo byetwa.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiri, nkamuha Giryadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ab'oruganda rwa Rubbeni n'aba Gaadi, nkabaha ensi ey'erukutandikira Giryadi ekahikira kimu ha kihanga eky'Aramooni, hagati y'ekihanga eki, nugwo omutaano, okuhikira kimu eruguru y'ekisaaru Yabboki, omutaano ogw'Abamooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nabaha na Araba, okutandikira Kineresi, okuhikira kimu ha Nyanja ey'Araba ey'Ekisura, ha bweculiko bwa Pisiga, ha bukiizi bwa Burugaizooba, Yorudaani, nugwo omutaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
