            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.12+NUM.27.13+NUM.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 27:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.48+DEU.32.49+DEU.32.50+DEU.32.51+DEU.32.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 32:48-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako konyini, nkeesengereza MUKAMA nti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ayi MUKAMA Ruhanga, hati nubwo watandika kwoleka omwiru wawe obukuru bwawe n'obusobozi bwawe; ruhanga ki anyakuli omwiguru rundi omunsi, arukusobora kukora ebikorwa ebirukusisana nka binu, kandi eby'amaani nkeebi wakozire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwesengeriize, onyikirize nyambuke ndole ensi enungi eri, enyakuli obuseeri bwa Yorudaani, ensi enungi ey'ensozi eri, na Lebbbanooni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
